 Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>, Greg Kroah-Hartman <gregkh@linuxfoundation.org>,
 marcel@holtmann.org, linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, tiwai@suse.com,
 stern@rowland.harvard.ed, linux-bluetooth@vger.kernel.org
